{"id":"sello","lemma":"sello","pos":"noun","rank":2810,"glosses":["seal, sigil","stamp (device for stamping designs)","stamp (imprint made by stamping)"],"ipa":"/ˈseʝo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"sellos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/ed/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-sello.wav","examples":[{"text":"Necesito un sello.","en":"I need a stamp.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/39593","words":[{"g":"to need","l":"necesitar"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Tengo un sello muy antiguo.","en":"I have a very old stamp.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/70225","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"a"},null,null,{"g":"old"}]},{"text":"Te daré cualquiera de estos sellos.","en":"I'll give you either of these stamps.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/689205","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to give, to give out","l":"dar"},{"g":"anyone"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"this","l":"este"},null]},{"text":"¿Por qué quieres sellos?","en":"Why do you want stamps?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/459722","words":[null,null,{"g":"to desire","l":"querer"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"why, for what reason"]]},{"text":"No olvides poner un sello en tu carta.","en":"Don't forget to put a stamp on your letter.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/730399","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to forget","l":"olvidar"},{"g":"to put, to place"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"your"},{"g":"letter"}]}]}